@startuml state02_account_approval
title Account Approval Status

[*] --> Approved : createProfile\n(gov/edu email)
[*] --> PendingApproval : createProfile\n(other email)

PendingApproval --> Approved : Admin approves

Approved --> [*]

note right of PendingApproval
  ProtectedRoute redirects every
  visit to /pending-approval until
  an Admin approves the account.
end note

note right of Approved
  Full access to the account's
  role-routed pages.
end note

@enduml
